      <title>樊振东德甲两盘3-0零封鲁伊斯与杜达，从去年2:3到今年完胜</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/%E6%A8%8A%E6%8C%AF%E4%B8%9C%E5%BE%B7%E7%94%B2%E4%B8%A4%E7%9B%983-0%E9%9B%B6%E5%B0%81%E9%B2%81%E4%BC%8A%E6%96%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%9C%E8%BE%BE%E4%BB%8E%E5%8E%BB%E5%B9%B423%E5%88%B0%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B4%E5%AE%8C%E8%83%9C/</link>
