    <item>
      <title>王楚钦连续三站退赛零处罚 与樊振东待遇反差凸显教练组策略</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/%E7%8E%8B%E6%A5%9A%E9%92%A6%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E4%B8%89%E7%AB%99%E9%80%80%E8%B5%9B%E9%9B%B6%E5%A4%84%E7%BD%9A-%E4%B8%8E%E6%A8%8A%E6%8C%AF%E4%B8%9C%E5%BE%85%E9%81%87%E5%8F%8D%E5%B7%AE%E5%87%B8%E6%98%BE%E6%95%99%E7%BB%83%E7%BB%84%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5/</link>
